List or extract the files of an ext2/3/4, erofs or f2fs image (with SELinux labels), no root needed

Usage: android-doctor files [OPTIONS] <IMAGE>

Arguments:
  <IMAGE>  

Options:
      --no-color         Never emit colour, even on a terminal (also honours the NO_COLOR environment variable)
  -o, --output <OUTPUT>  Extract into this new directory (files/ plus manifest.json); without it, list only
      --json             Print JSON instead of text
  -h, --help             Print help
